  "title": "First Horizon Bank and United Way of Southeast Louisiana Announce Meghan Donelon is Appointed Executive Committee Board Chair",
  "summary": "First Horizon Bank (NYSE: FHN) (or \"First Horizon\") and United Way of Southeast Louisiana (UWSELA) today announced that Meghan Donelon, Commercial Banking Group Manager at First Horizon Bank, has been appointed the new Executive Committee Board Chair for UWSELA. As a lifelong New Orleanian, Donelon brings nearly two decades of banking experience and a long-standing commitment to community leadership to this board chair position. This complements her role as Senior Vice President and Commercial B",
